#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:3
#: fc601a4975be477a9b6136b3ab4ca4c9
msgid "Package contributions"
msgstr "軟體包貢獻"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:6
#: baa9b3c88e094f16bb4a918211172382
msgid ""
"*This page is for developers who wish to contribute packages. If you want to "
"install contributed packages, please see* :doc:`installing contributed "
"packages </user/advanced-topics/installing-contributed-packages>` *.*"
msgstr ""
"*此頁面適用於希望貢獻軟體包的開發者。如果您想安裝已貢獻的軟體包，請參閱* :"
"doc:`安裝已貢獻的軟體包 </user/advanced-topics/installing-contributed-"
"packages>` *。*"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:8
#: b2de6b16963f49fdb0b6e735250bb77a
msgid ""
"We’re very grateful to the talented and hard-working community members who "
"contribute software packages to Qubes OS. This page explains the inclusion "
"criteria and procedures for such packages, as well as the roles and "
"responsibilities of those involved."
msgstr ""
"我們非常感謝才華橫溢且勤奮努力的社群成員為 Qubes OS 貢獻軟體軟體包。此頁面說"
"明了此類軟體包的納入標準和程序，以及相關人員的角色和職責。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:11
#: d14fc60a30b245798e86fc852a389c56
msgid "Inclusion Criteria"
msgstr "納入標準"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:14
#: 138158da3d1844ae99102bfffa2fb6e8
msgid "In order to be accepted, packages must:"
msgstr "為了被接受，軟體包必須："

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:16
#: 32c613de895b4cbb914b2efa771fa94f
msgid "In no way weaken the security of Qubes OS."
msgstr "不得以任何方式削弱 Qubes OS 的安全性。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:18
#: e6c6610e75ca4e8892e2a16f02b50da3
msgid ""
"Be published under an open-source license (read about the :doc:`Qubes OS "
"License </developer/code/license>`)."
msgstr ""
"以開源授權發佈（請參閱 :doc:`Qubes OS 授權 </developer/code/license>`）。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:20
#: 93223c38b72348a2a936890b11f58850
msgid "Follow our :doc:`coding guidelines </developer/code/coding-style>`."
msgstr "遵循我們的 :doc:`程式碼撰寫指南 </developer/code/coding-style>`。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:22
#: 2738e309e3f1490387f5a4656734af46
msgid "Be thoroughly tested."
msgstr "經過徹底測試。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:24
#: 6cec6569eed049efbcd8aa8ab2989f49
msgid "Have a clearly-defined use case for Qubes users."
msgstr "為 Qubes 使用者提供明確定義的使用案例。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:26
#: 24b20a3318aa417cae584256b29184c5
msgid "Not be unduly burdensome to review."
msgstr "審查時不會造成過度負擔。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:30
#: d25b361403484ca7b533fb9f17452869
msgid ""
"(Please note that we always reserve the right to add criteria to this list.)"
msgstr "（請注意，我們保留隨時對此列表新增標準的權利。）"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:33
#: f9fd8203990e4827961150f0ce0ef0c7
msgid "Contribution Procedure"
msgstr "貢獻程序"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:36
#: f9061fd4d05249e19f08a9db91153a12
msgid ""
"Before you start putting serious work into a package, we recommend that you "
"discuss your idea with the Qubes developers and the broader community on "
"the :ref:`qubes-devel mailing list <introduction/support:qubes-devel>`. Once "
"you have a package that’s ready to become part of Qubes OS, please follow "
"this procedure:"
msgstr ""
"在您開始對軟體包投入大量工作之前，我們建議您先在 :ref:`qubes-devel 郵件列表 "
"<introduction/support:qubes-devel>`上與 Qubes 開發者和更廣泛的社群討論您的想"
"法。一旦您準備好了一個可以成為 Qubes OS 一部分的軟體包，請遵循以下程序："

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:38
#: a8191966ef45409e91c0c9e49aece215
msgid ""
"Ensure that your package satisfies the :ref:`developer/general/package-"
"contributions:inclusion criteria`."
msgstr ""
"確保您的軟體包符合\\ :ref:`納入標準 <developer/general/package-contributions:"
"inclusion criteria>`\\ 。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:40
#: 08f1b3fa03d740aa8bad84456abdb6ab
msgid ""
"If your code isn’t already on GitHub, create a GitHub repo that contains "
"your code. You can have a look to an example package called `qubes-skeleton "
"<https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib/qubes-skeleton>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果您的程式碼尚未在 GitHub 上，請建立一個包含您程式碼的 GitHub 儲存庫。您可"
"以參考一個名為 `qubes-skeleton <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib/qubes-"
"skeleton>`__ 的範例軟體包。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:42
#: bd02666f444c45a4b1d35e80de9e1d21
msgid ""
"If you haven’t already, :doc:`sign your code </developer/code/code-signing>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您還沒有，請 :doc:`簽署您的程式碼 </developer/code/code-signing>`。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:44
#: 34c5a57cf89043f3b8dbbd94bc176f7d
msgid ""
"Create an issue in `qubes-issues <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/"
"issues/>`__ with the title ``[Contribution] your-package-name``. Include a "
"link to your repo, a brief description of your package, and a brief "
"explanation of why you think it should be included in Qubes. Please note "
"that the Qubes core developers are very busy. If they are under heavy load "
"when you submit your contribution, it may be a very long time before they "
"have time to review your package. If this happens, please do not be "
"discouraged. If you think they may have forgotten about your pending "
"contribution, you may “bump” your request by commenting on your issue, but "
"please do this *very* sparingly (i.e., no more than once a month). We "
"appreciate your understanding!"
msgstr ""
"在 `qubes-issues <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/>`__ 中建立"
"一個標題為 ``[Contribution] your-package-name`` 的議題。包含您儲存庫的連結、"
"軟體包的簡短說明，以及您認為它應納入 Qubes 的簡短理由。請注意，Qubes 核心開發"
"者非常忙碌。如果您提交貢獻時他們正處於高負載狀態，可能需要很長時間他們才有時"
"間審查您的軟體包。如果發生這種情況，請不要氣餒。如果您認為他們可能忘記了您待"
"處理的貢獻，您可以透過在議題上留言來「推」您的請求，但請*非常節制*地這麼做"
"（即每月不超過一次）。感謝您的理解！"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:46
#: e83b549c876b46bfbe82a9a92a0b9fb1
msgid ""
"You may be asked followup questions. If we decide to accept your "
"contribution, you will be invited to join the `QubesOS-contrib <https://"
"github.com/QubesOS-contrib>`__ organization on GitHub as public recognition "
"of your contribution (but without push access; see :ref:`developer/general/"
"package-contributions:review procedure`), and `QubesOS-contrib <https://"
"github.com/QubesOS-contrib>`__ will fork your repo. If we decide not to "
"accept your contribution, we will state the reason and close the issue."
msgstr ""
"您可能會被詢問後續問題。如果我們決定接受您的貢獻，您將被邀請加入 GitHub 上的 "
"`QubesOS-contrib <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib>`__ 組織，作為您貢獻的公"
"開認可（但沒有推送權限；請參閱 :ref:`審查程序 <developer/general/package-"
"contributions:review procedure>`），而 `QubesOS-contrib <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS-contrib>`__ 將 fork 您的儲存庫。如果我們決定不接受您的貢獻，我們將說"
"明原因並關閉議題。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:51
#: 2bb79edcde04446ea3a7324f22061537
msgid "Update Procedure"
msgstr "更新程序"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:54
#: 82b6c253c48a4538a71029d075416d45
msgid ""
"*Anyone* can provide an update (patch) to a contributed package, not just "
"the person who contributed that package! The update procedure is the same "
"for everyone, including the original package contributor."
msgstr ""
"*任何*\\ 人都可以為已貢獻的軟體包提供更新（修補程式），不僅僅是貢獻該軟體包的"
"人！更新程序對所有人都相同，包括原始軟體包貢獻者。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:56
#: 43aa0535b1eb4cb39dfe248e24da5e07
msgid ""
"If you would like to update an already-contributed package (specifically, a "
"fork owned by `QubesOS-contrib <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib>`__), "
"please submit a :doc:`signed </developer/code/code-signing>`, fast-"
"forwardable pull request to that repo with your changes. Please note that "
"your pull request **must** be both :doc:`signed </developer/code/code-"
"signing>` and fast-forwardable, or else it will be closed without further "
"review. One or more reviewers may post comments on your pull request. Please "
"be prepared to read and respond to these comments."
msgstr ""
"如果您想更新一個已貢獻的軟體包（特別是 `QubesOS-contrib <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS-contrib>`__ 擁有的 fork），請向該儲存庫提交一個 :doc:`已簽署 </"
"developer/code/code-signing>`、可快轉合併的拉取請求，包含您的變更。請注意，您"
"的拉取請求**必須**同時是 :doc:`已簽署 </developer/code/code-signing>` 且可快"
"轉合併的，否則它將在未經進一步審查的情況下被關閉。一位或多位審查者可能會在您"
"的拉取請求上發表評論。請準備好閱讀並回覆這些評論。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:59
#: 18a65cd34db1437592bfbff2a00dbb33
msgid "Review Procedure"
msgstr "審查程序"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:62
#: 2b21acf631ae4799a45fa0936bbb255a
msgid ""
"This review procedure covers both original package contributions (see :ref:"
"`developer/general/package-contributions:contribution procedure`) and all "
"subsequent updates to those packages, including updates from the original "
"package contributor (see :ref:`developer/general/package-contributions:"
"update procedure`). All changes will be reviewed by a Qubes Core Reviewer "
"(QCR) and the :ref:`Package Maintainer <developer/general/package-"
"contributions:package maintainers>` (PM). In all cases, the QCR will be a "
"core Qubes developer. In some cases, the QCR and the PM will be the same "
"person. For example, if someone contributes a package, then disappears, and "
"no suitable replacement has been found, then it is likely that a core Qubes "
"developer will play both the QCR and PM roles for that package, at least "
"until another suitable candidate volunteers to become the PM for that "
"package."
msgstr ""
"此審查程序涵蓋原始軟體包貢獻（請參閱 :ref:`貢獻程序 <developer/general/"
"package-contributions:contribution procedure>`）以及對這些軟體包的所有後續更"
"新，包括來自原始軟體包貢獻者的更新（請參閱 :ref:`更新程序 <developer/general/"
"package-contributions:update procedure>`）。所有變更將由 Qubes Core Reviewer"
"（QCR）和 :ref:`軟體包維護者 <developer/general/package-contributions:"
"package maintainers>`（PM）審查。在所有情況下，QCR 將是 Qubes 核心開發者。在"
"某些情況下，QCR 和 PM可能是同一個人。例如，如果有人貢獻了一個軟體包然後消失，"
"且找不到合適的替代者，那麼核心 Qubes 開發者很可能會同時擔任該軟體包的 QCR 和 "
"PM 角色，至少直到另一位合適的候選人自願成為該軟體包的 PM 為止。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:64
#: cebb145e572d49d7a2752f0c5580c95e
msgid "The review procedure is as follows:"
msgstr "審查程序如下："

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:66
#: d5c8a667c0104f5aa4859914d8ff6e8d
msgid "Someone, S, wishes to make a change to a package, P."
msgstr "某人 S 想要對軟體包 P 進行變更。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:68
#: 627d3d12231142b6b23926ca1e83fda5
msgid ""
"S submits a fast-forwardable pull request against the fork of P’s repo owned "
"by `QubesOS-contrib <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib>`__."
msgstr ""
"S 向 `QubesOS-contrib <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib>`__ 擁有的 P 儲存"
"庫 fork 提交一個可快轉合併的拉取請求。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:70
#: 357cf32e4b6a4729be55e548135e70f2
msgid ""
"The PM reviews the pull request. If the pull request passes the PM’s review, "
"the PM adds a :doc:`signed </developer/code/code-signing>` *comment* on the "
"pull request stating that it has passed review. (In cases in which S = PM, "
"the PM can simply add a :doc:`signed </developer/code/code-signing>` *tag* "
"to the HEAD commit prior to submitting the pull request.) If the pull "
"request does not pass the PM’s review, the PM leaves a comment on the pull "
"request explaining why not."
msgstr ""
"PM 審查拉取請求。如果拉取請求通過 PM 的審查，PM 會在拉取請求上新增一個 :doc:`"
"已簽署 </developer/code/code-signing>` *評論*，說明它已通過審查。（在 S = PM "
"的情況下，PM 可以在提交拉取請求之前，簡單地在 HEAD 提交上新增一個 :doc:`已簽"
"署 </developer/code/code-signing>` *標籤*。）如果拉取請求未通過 PM 的審查，"
"PM 會在拉取請求上留言說明原因。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:72
#: 45c6267295a24d23a2fb67627c4da493
msgid ""
"The QCR reviews the pull request. If the pull request passes the QCR’s "
"review, the QCR pushes a :doc:`signed </developer/code/code-signing>` tag to "
"the HEAD commit stating that it has passed review and fast-forward merges "
"the pull request. If the pull request does not pass the QCR’s review, the "
"QCR leaves a comment on the pull request explaining why not, and the QCR may "
"decide to close the pull request."
msgstr ""
"QCR 審查拉取請求。如果拉取請求通過 QCR 的審查，QCR 會將一個 :doc:`已簽署 </"
"developer/code/code-signing>` 標籤推送到 HEAD 提交，說明它已通過審查，並以快"
"轉合併方式合併拉取請求。如果拉取請求未通過 QCR 的審查，QCR 會在拉取請求上留言"
"說明原因，並且 QCR 可能決定關閉拉取請求。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:76
#: d2766a3821334a6c87e0b67fa78ed76c
msgid ""
"In all the cases, the first condition to be validated by the QCR’s review is "
"to ensure that the contribution **will not** hijack any core packages of "
"`QubesOS <https://github.com/QubesOS>`__ and of course, none of the `QubesOS-"
"contrib <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib>`__ packages too. More "
"precisely, particular attention to the whole build pipeline will be made "
"with a specific review of:"
msgstr ""
"在所有情況下，QCR 審查要驗證的第一個條件是確保貢獻**不會**劫持 `QubesOS "
"<https://github.com/QubesOS>`__ 的任何核心軟體包，當然也不會劫持 `QubesOS-"
"contrib <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib>`__ 的任何軟體包。更具體地說，將"
"特別關注整個建置管線，並具體審查："

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:78
#: 9ebad0ab595847ab8254bad98d570fdd
msgid "Package dependencies,"
msgstr "軟體包相依性，"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:80
#: 3cf5642ca42946278f8020bc352a0e1a
msgid "Build scripts (including downloaded ones),"
msgstr "建置腳本（包括下載的）、"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:82
#: 42b81618179d4f6996d1116397292c5a
msgid "All downloaded components should be verified against static hash,"
msgstr "所有下載的元件應根據靜態雜湊值進行驗證，"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:84
#: c122d19e69794accb2c07349f1d9624d
msgid ""
"RPM/DEB installation scripts (e.g. looking at constraints who would hijack "
"other packages),"
msgstr "RPM/DEB 安裝指令稿（例如檢查那些會劫持其他軟體包的限制條件），"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:86
#: df77669595f042e38193922290b8a3fe
msgid "Makefiles,"
msgstr "Makefile，"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:88
#: 2583860b772d4f2aa3dfad3922bc2814
msgid "Package build `reproducible <https://reproducible-builds.org/>`__"
msgstr "軟體包建置的`可重現性 <https://reproducible-builds.org/>`__"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:92
#: 2cda3830880b4a1fa0e96cf59c4815e8
msgid ""
"and any steps which would result in partial/total compromise of legitimate "
"components. For this part, you can have a look to an example package called "
"`qubes-skeleton <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib/qubes-skeleton>`__."
msgstr ""
"以及任何會導致合法元件部分/完全受損的步驟。對於這部分，您可以參考一個名為 "
"`qubes-skeleton <https://github.com/QubesOS-contrib/qubes-skeleton>`__ 的範例"
"軟體包。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:95
#: 446736eaf9014b61bc6263f6e1eb8ec7
msgid "Package Maintainers"
msgstr "軟體包維護者"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:98
#: 52f37c48dd484f08bfeb5c14cec381c3
msgid ""
"If you contribute a package, we assume that you will be the maintainer of "
"that package, unless you tell us otherwise. As the maintainer of the "
"package, it is your privilege and responsibility to:"
msgstr ""
"如果您貢獻了一個軟體包，我們會假設您將成為該軟體包的維護者，除非您告知我們否"
"則。作為軟體包的維護者，您的權利和責任是："

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:100
#: 38347ac1e1884cb3b724fa9dc94b90ec
msgid ""
":ref:`Review <developer/general/package-contributions:review procedure>` "
"each pull request made against the package."
msgstr ""
":ref:`審查 <developer/general/package-contributions:review procedure>` 針對該"
"軟體包提出的每個拉取請求。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:102
#: 3a2ca5478b874723af01a746beb6beab
msgid ""
"Decide when the package has reached a new version, and notify the Qubes core "
"developers when this occurs."
msgstr "決定軟體包何時達到新版本，並在發生時通知 Qubes 核心開發者。"

#: ../../../developer/general/package-contributions.rst:106
#: 8fc9afd36d0d4b2488c957890277a76f
msgid ""
"If you do not wish to be the maintainer of your package, please let us know. "
"If you do not act on your maintainer duties for a given package for an "
"extended period of time and after at least one reminder, we will assume that "
"you no longer wish to be the maintainer for that package."
msgstr ""
"如果您不希望成為軟體包的維護者，請告知我們。如果您在很長一段時間內且至少在收"
"到一次提醒後仍未履行對某個軟體包的維護職責，我們將假設您不再希望成為該軟體包"
"的維護者。"
